===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Trubbish|168}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Drool''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Erika's Weepinbell|48}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

